<title>PORTUGAL: Share, bond trade resumes on Lisbon bourse-dealers.</title>
<headline>Share, bond trade resumes on Lisbon bourse-dealers.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in cash shares and bonds resumed at 0910 GMT on the Lisbon bourse after an interruption of around 30 minutes, dealers.</p>
<p>The interruption was due to technical problems.</p>
<p>The PSI20  .PSI20 was down 2.76 percent as European share markets reacted to the more than three percent fall on Wall Street on Friday. The Lisbon market was closed on Friday for a holiday.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
